  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of Waste Separation at source and Resource Circulation Project for Municipal Solid Waste in Long An Province, Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of awareness of separate emissions, promotion and educational activities conducted, Established separation discharge and separation collection equipment and infrastructure, Construction and operation, Establishment and operation of waste screening facilities, Reinforcement of policy and technical capabilities related to waste resource conversion, Establishment of waste resource Action Plan</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support policies and infrastructure for the settlement of separate collection for waste resources and waste to energy in Long An Province, and To improve environmental pollution and quality of residents&apos; lives by contributing to reducing waste and greenhouse gas emissions through strengthening capabilities.- &#xC0DD;&#xD65C;&#xD3D0;&#xAE30;&#xBB3C; &#xBD84;&#xB9AC;&#xBC30;&#xCD9C; &#xC2DC;&#xC2A4;&#xD15C; &#xC815;&#xCC29;
